# The seal (engine/RULEBOOK.md R-79, the retro after M0, decision 9): ripgrep, fd and the
# Grep tool read this file and skip what it lists: the hidden keys
# (engine/tests/cases/*-hidden.md) and the sealed folders (tmp/holdout/, tmp/cases-holdout/).
# Unanchored on purpose: ripgrep run from a subfolder misses an anchored line of a parent
# folder's ignore file. The guard refuses the searches that skip this file (rg -u,
# --no-ignore, a positive -g glob) or read none (grep -r, find, ls -R, git grep).
*-hidden.md
holdout/
cases-holdout/
